qualification_repair = "Initial continuation verification at f046f16074b9e17ca2dc4a8822713a8c3a663507, command cg spec done 22.33.1254 -f layerx-merge --root /work/paxeer-monorepo, exit 1, private evidence /out/logs/verify-1.log: 24 cases failed at the same balance assertion because reflect equality distinguished nil from empty big.Int zero limbs. Balance assertions now require Cmp == 0, exact numeric equality, before and after reopening; all payment, rollback, routing and reward assertions remain enforced."
